                                                                                                                                               "typeName":  "dsDescriptionValue",
                                                                                                                                               "multiple":  false,
                                                                                                                                               "typeClass":  "primitive",
                                                                                                                                               "value":  "This dataset contains data collected during the 2020 agricultural season in the Lower Mondego Valley case study (Portugal). The experiment was conducted in pilot fields located on two experimental farms: Quinta do Canal (Alqueidão) and Bico da Barca (Alqueidão). At each farm, two experimental irrigation strategies were tested: (1) wet seeding with continuous flooding (WFL) and (2) wet seeding with alternate wetting and drying (AWD). The dataset also includes the experimental field layouts and details on the cultivated rice varieties."
                                                                                                                                           }
                                                                                                                }
                                                                                                            ]
